#: toplevel.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<p>Do you want to generate a backtrace? This will help the developers to figure out what went wrong.</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately this will take some time on slow machines.</p><p><b>Note: A backtrace is not a substitute for a proper description of the bug and information on how to reproduce it. It is not possible to fix the bug without a proper description.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kireez yasísı kiläme? Alay bulsa, citeşterüçelärenä ni kilep çıqqanın añlaw ciñelräk bulaçaq.</p>\n"
"<p>Bu eş äkren sanaqlarda ozaq bara qızğanıçqa qarşı.</p><p><b>Belderü: Betneñ kireeze anı turında açıqlawçı yomğaq belän anı qabar buldıru ısulın añlatuın tulısınça almştıra almí. Tulı açıqlama birelmäsä, betne beterep bulmí.</b></p>"

